footer Dipelihara di docs/diagram-uml, render dari sumber .puml
title Status unit inventaris dan perpindahannya
state "available" as available
state "reserved" as reserved
state "in_service" as in_service
state "returned" as returned
state "sold" as sold

[*] --> available : unit didaftarkan batch IMEI
available --> reserved : ditahan untuk pembeli
reserved --> available : tahan dibatalkan
available --> in_service : masuk meja servis
reserved --> in_service : unit yang ditahan masuk servis
in_service --> returned : keluar meja servis
returned --> available : kembali dijual
returned --> in_service : servis ulang
available --> sold : terjual lewat checkout kasir
sold --> [*]

note right of sold
  sold hanya lewat transaksi kasir agar nota tercatat.
  Pemicu BEFORE UPDATE OF status menolak
  perubahan status dari sold.
end note
note bottom of returned
  Admin dan sales boleh memilih status non-sold
  mana pun lewat /portal/inventory.
  Teknisi hanya boleh in_service dan returned.
end note
@enduml
